  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountsOfReductionEntryOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;※８　有形固定資産の圧縮記帳額&lt;/p&gt;
